<title>UK: UK grain traders seek free market wheat and barley.</title>
<headline>UK grain traders seek free market wheat and barley.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK grain traders bid for licences to export free market wheat and barley at the weekly European Union (EU) tender held on Thursday, the UK Intervention Board for Agricultural Produce said.</p>
<p>The board was unable to give further details because there were fewer than three bids, it said.</p>
<p>--Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8062</p>
</text>
